# Third-party prose staged for measurement, never redistributed. `human-excerpts.json` holds
# ~294k words of Mother of Learning and RoyalRoad chapters and this repository is public;
# it is a build product of `taste_calibration.py --dump` over corpora that live on the machine,
# and it regenerates in one command. The *results* files carry only ids and verdicts.
research/quality-measurement/corpora/human-excerpts.json
# Matched-pair benchmark corpus: third-party RoyalRoad and Mother of Learning prose, staged for
# measurement and never redistributed. Same rule as human-excerpts.json above — it is a build
# product of `taste_benchmark.py --build` and regenerates in one command. The committed record is
# the text-free sidecar results/taste-benchmark-corpus.json, which carries every pair's covariates.
research/quality-measurement/corpora/taste-benchmark.json


# Run logs. The JSON and JSONL beside them are the artifacts.
research/quality-measurement/results/*.log
